# Binsec/Rel constant-time check for aes_subword (Tier B per ADR-0009).
#
# aes_subword applies aes_sbox to each of the 4 bytes of a 32-bit word
# (helper used by AES key expansion). Four straight-line aes_sbox
# calls; aes_sbox itself is constant-time (separately proven). Secret
# is the input word.

starting from <aes_subword> with
  sp := 0x90000000
  ra := 0xDEADBEEF
  a0 := secret as input_word
end

halt at <aes_subword> return

explore all
